    {
      "title": "Actor Imran Khan to move Bombay High Court against notice asking him to leave India",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/videos/actor-imran-khan-to-move-bombay-high-court-against-notice-asking-him-to-leave-india/article71591866.ece",
      "description": "Actor Imran Khan is set to approach the Bombay High Court after receiving a notice asking him to leave the country following his participation in a protest. The actor is expected to challenge the legality of the notice and seek judicial relief.",
